     A*
     A* Rx Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 10/11/2002 by c:62 for Project 114MEK
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from Rx.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PP901                     TEXT('Rx Bill Trans Info')
     A            P9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('RXFINPT Mbr#')
     A            P9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAP0P member #')
     A            P9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAP9P record created.
     A*
     A            P9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            P9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from RXFINPT
     A*           member to FAP1P
     A*
     A            P9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            P9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAP1P records have a value
     A*           in P1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the RXFINPT member from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           Rx Bills" screen, since all the FAP1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            P9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            P9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            P9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            P9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            P9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            P9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            P9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            P9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            P9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            P9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
